OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal for major energy storage
OL,4,Asystem rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FProposals to install a major battery
OL,7,Fenergy storage system have been
OL,8,Frejected after an appeal by the
OL,9,Fdeveloper was dismissed.
OL,11,FSky UK Development's plans for the
OL,12,Fbattery system site (BESS) on land near
OL,13,FRaymond's Hill in Axminster were
OL,14,Frefused by East Devon District
OL,15,FCouncil's planning committee last year.
OL,17,FThe applicant appealed the decision
OL,18,Fwith the Planning Inspectorate,
OL,19,Fproposing changes to mitigate concerns
OL,20,Faround groundwater contamination and
OL,21,Fthe risk of battery units catching
OL,22,Ffire.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
