OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal for major energy storage
OL,4,Asystem rejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn her decision, inspector RC Kirby
OL,7,Fsaid such mitigation "would not be
OL,8,Feffective" in ensuring an acceptable
OL,9,Fbalance between harm and benefit",
OL,10,Fstating the proposal was "not suitable
OL,11,Ffor its location".
